     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Q1 2021: No progress yet
Q2 2021: Some preparatory works have been undertaken including the finalization of a TOR for selecting the responsible parties.

Q3 2021: 
1.One semi-government entity (PWP) was selected rehabilitate/improve gender sensitive market facilities/infrastructure. The identification of market facilities are on-going.

Q4 2021: 
1. 10 Market infrastructures have been identified for Hadramaut and Aden
2. Access to financial services will be commenced in 2022 following the provision of business skills and capacity-building. 
3. The identification of business associations started in 2021. Additionally, support to the establishment of businesswomen union/association also started for Hadramaut.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
